Article 4 (Survey Items)
(1) The Mining and Manufacturing Survey shall cover the following matters: <Amended on October 5, 2015; November 9, 2021; October 1, 2025>
1. Basic matters concerning the establishment, including its name and location;
2. Matters concerning business operations, including organizational form, number of workers, and annual payroll;
3. Matters concerning capital and tangible assets;
4. Matters concerning business performance, including sales and operating expenses;
5. Matters concerning products, including shipment value by item;
6. Other matters determined by the Administrator of the National Data Agency as necessary to identify industrial structure and management conditions.
(2) Detailed items concerning the matters under paragraph (1) shall be determined by the Administrator of the National Data Agency. <Amended on October 1, 2025>
